ContainsMoney & ContainsFree & Class \\
\midrule
Yes & Yes & Spam \\
Yes & No & Spam \\
No & No & NotSpam \\
No & Yes & NotSpam \\
Yes & Yes & Spam \\
No & No & NotSpam \\
\bottomrule
