\end{align*}
\boxed{\text{Accuracy}=0.85,\ \text{Precision}=0.25,\ \text{Recall}=1.0,\ F1=0.4}
Although accuracy looks high (85\%), the very low precision reveals the classifier is predicting "Positive" far too often — this is exactly why accuracy alone can be misleading. \checkmark

